              "text": "candidātus, candidātī — \"a candidate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Candidātus cīvēs in forō salūtābat. The candidate was greeting the citizens in the Forum."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "candidātus, candidātī m., from candidus, shining white: a man seeking office wore a toga whitened with chalk. English candidate."
            }
          ]
        },
