              "text": "ambitiō, ambitiōnis — \"canvassing; ambition\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ambitiō eius omnibus nōta erat. His canvassing was known to all."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ambitiō, ambitiōnis f., built on ambiō, to go round: the candidate went round asking for votes. English ambition."
